    ("In the Eisenhower Time Management Matrix, how are tasks categorized across the four quadrants?", "By Urgency and Importance (Urgent vs Not Urgent, Important vs Not Important)", ["By Difficulty and Cost", "By Department and Seniority", "By Employee Name and Salary"], "The Eisenhower Matrix prioritizes tasks based on whether they are urgent and whether they are strategically important."),
